{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/68e15238f324875547ab9535cf7e97b4.avif?t=1772575454\" width=666 height=375 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through four mysterious worlds, each teeming with danger and wonder. Face off against fearsome enemies born from the sinister Green Mist, and uncover the secrets behind their creation. Rescue your fellow bees scattered across the realms\u2014they\u2019ll join your quest, To find the flower Of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/c2137b51450edd86dd6fa2bb172c5c08.poster.avif?t=1772575454\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/c2137b51450edd86dd6fa2bb172c5c08.webm?t=1772575454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/c2137b51450edd86dd6fa2bb172c5c08.mp4?t=1772575454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/95f3b65e8cea1a1a0fe80d6bf3f42853.avif?t=1772575454\" width=816 height=306 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Queen\u2019s son. The Queen has fallen gravely ill by a disease born from the Green Mist. This mist gave rise to evil things\u2026 twisted creatures born from the mist spread across the land, driving other bugs into madness. Only one thing can save her now: the Flower of Life,an ancient legend passed down for hundreds of years. To find it, you must venture into places no bug has ever gone and returned alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/2809482adf84d0069474ccc34f43417c.poster.avif?t=1772575454\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/2809482adf84d0069474ccc34f43417c.webm?t=1772575454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/extras/2809482adf84d0069474ccc34f43417c.mp4?t=1772575454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955300?t=1772575454","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/d6e6a09d46282275713ba7237fa725391d01d83d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772575454","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/1cbb08b42368f572b72d9e0f24560822d89d4233/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772575454","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955300/1cbb08b42368f572b72d9e0f24560822d89d4233/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772575454","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4106170,"description":""},{"appid":4106170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/